    "你举起手示意投降，伏罗很快注意到这一点，随即放下了双臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_710636c4:

    # v "Not going any further? We can stop here."
    v "不打算继续了吗？我们可以到此为止。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_2f57f6fe:

    # "You fall to your knees, exhausted of all your energy. You grasp for breath as you lie on the ground, thinking surrendering yourself to the buggbear might be the best choice."
    "你跪倒在地，浑身力气几乎耗尽，只能躺在那里大口喘息。也许向熊地精投降，才是最好的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_f800fe89:

    # "You fall to your knees, exhausted all your energy, you grasp for breath as you lie on the ground, surrendering yourself to the guardian."
    "你跪倒在地，力气已经耗尽，只能躺在那里喘息，向守护者投降。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_09949f9d:

    # "You fall to your knees, exhausted all your energy, you grasp for breath as you lie on the ground, surrendering yourself to the cultist in front of you."
    "你耗尽力气跪倒在地，躺在那里喘息，将自己交给面前的邪教信徒。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_c7b51060:

    # "The acolyte watches in amusement, staring at you in the same stoic mask."
    "邪教信徒饶有兴致地看着你，脸上仍戴着那副毫无表情的面具。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_47f4bdd0:

    # "You fall to your knees, having exhausted all your energy. You feel the slime has overpowered you in every way possible."
    "你跪倒在地，力气已经耗尽。你清楚地感到，史莱姆在各个方面都彻底压倒了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_664ea1cc:

    # "With no possible outcome in sight, you surrender yourself to its gooey grasp..."
    "眼前已看不到任何转机，你只得向它投降，任由它黏稠的身躯将你攫住……"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_75066d56:

    # "You fall to your knees, exhausted all your energy, you grasp for breath as you lie on the ground."
    "你跪倒在地，力气已经耗尽，只能躺在那里喘息。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_ec66902a:

    # "Maybe surrendering yourself to the [target.name!t] is the best choice."
    "也许向[target.name!t]投降，才是最好的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_c69bc257:

    # a "Are we giving up?"
    a "我们要放弃吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_6ef9c502:

    # "The beast man jeers at your submission, and he paces around you, poking you to see if you'd still react."
    "那个兽人嘲弄着你的投降，绕着你踱步，不时戳你一下，确认你还会不会反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_b2a8349a:

    # "You slowly close your eyes and wait for him to decide your fate."
    "你慢慢闭上眼睛，等待它决定你的命运。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_c764976e:

    # gt "Ha... At least you are smart enough to give yourself up to our chief. But, since we're here. I have a better plan for you."
    gt "哈……至少你还聪明，知道该把自己交给我们的首领。不过既然我们已经在这里，我倒有个更好的计划。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_5fa880da:

    # "He laughs at your submission and looks you up and down. Thinking carefully about his next step..."
    "他嘲笑着你的投降，上下打量着你，仔细盘算下一步该怎么做……"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_65ca3b04:

    # gt "Well... it seems we're done...heh. I thought our general said you're strong... not strong enough."
    gt "嗯……看来我们到此为止了……呵。我还以为将军说你很强……看来也没强到哪儿去。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_escape_surrender_script_02490d6b:

    # "He looks at you up and down..."
    "他上下打量着你……"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_ally_script_2fe31d4b:

