    # "You can't point out what happened or what changed, but your body feels... weird after losing to the mimic."
    "你说不清发生了什么，也不知道改变的是什么；但输给宝箱怪后，你的身体感觉……很奇怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite mimic_lose_fde7f20e:

    # "Like... it's not your own."
    "就好像……这副身体已经不属于你。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_528eb585:

    # "It is a Rune Guardian. He is standing before you, he looks enraged by your intrusion."
    "符石护卫伫立在你面前，显然因你的闯入而怒不可遏。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_8ed9f221:

    # "You can feel his blue aura radiates across the cave."
    "你能感觉到他的蓝色光晕辐射整座山洞。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_456c4288:

    # "You raise your [pc.weapon.name!t], defending yourself from the guardian's attack."
    "你举起[pc.weapon.name!t]，准备抵挡符石护卫的攻击。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_35c2da0e:

    # "You raise your fist, defending yourself from the guardian's attack."
    "你举起拳头，准备抵挡符石护卫的攻击。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_loop_e63e900e:

    # "The Rune Guardian aims and flings 3 huge stones at you, it ignores your dodges and hit you right onto your body. Your health decreases by [ed] HP."
    "符石护卫瞄准后掷出三块巨石；石块无视你的闪避，径直砸中你。你的生命值减少了 [ed] 点。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_loop_8133aa7b:

    # "The Rune Guardian holds you in place with his right arm. You try to struggle free but it doesn't work."
    "符石护卫用右臂将你牢牢按住。你试图挣脱，却无济于事。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_loop_8dd06c89:

    # "The guardian swing his fist toward your direction, hitting you in the chest. Your health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "符石护卫朝你挥拳，击中你的胸口。你的生命值减少了 [enemy_damage] 点。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_loop_f6c92ffb:

    # "The guardian strike you down with his vines, you pass out for a few seconds before getting up. Your health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "符石护卫用藤蔓将你击倒。你昏迷了几秒，才重新站起。你的生命值减少了 [enemy_damage] 点。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_loop_9399e2c4:

    # "The guardian swing his fist toward your direction, but you manage to dodge his blow."
    "符石护卫朝你挥拳，但你成功躲开了这一击。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_loop_d4f76538:

    # "The guardian tries to strike you down with his vines, but he missed the attack just by inches."
    "符石护卫试图用藤蔓将你击倒，但只差几寸便打偏了。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_loop_edbb71f1:

    # "The guardian prepares for his magic... you feel like his next attack would hurt a lot more."
    "符石护卫开始准备魔法……你感觉它下一次攻击会造成更多伤害。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_loop_59d3dccc:

    # k "Courier, watch out for his attack!"
    k "信使，小心它的攻击！"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_loop_af541553:

    # "The Rune Guardian channels the water into an orb of regeneration, his body becomes revitalised by the power of water."
    "符石护卫将水汇聚成再生法球，水之力让它的身体重新焕发生机。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_battle_loop_8fd8c645:

    # "He has recovered [healing] HP."
    "他的生命值恢复了 [healing] 点。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_d87424a9:

    # "The Rune Guardian collapse on the ground, you stare at the guardian, its blue marks are glowly weakly."
    "符石护卫轰然倒地；你看着它身上的蓝色印记逐渐黯淡。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_a5b8bed6:

    # "Holding the stone against the golem. The shell of the rock crumbles and reveals a rune crystal right before your eyes."
    "你将捡来的石头抵在石魔像胸前。石头的外壳碎裂，露出一枚符文晶体。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_ddbc5ca2:

    # k "W-what?"
    k "怎、怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_81daaa47:

    # e "I think it's glowing..."
    e "我觉得它在发光……"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_7469aa9c:

    # "The rune fuses into the chest of the dying guardian, and the whole cave glows with bright blue energy."
    "符文晶体融入垂死的符石护卫胸口，整座山洞都被明亮的蓝光照亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_7df9c133:

    # "Soon, everything returns to normal, except that the guardian seems to not disintegrate like the last one did."
    "很快，一切恢复正常，只有符石护卫没有像上一个那样解体。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_da5ef959:

    # k "It was a weird stone... how did you know it'd save the guardian?"
    k "那是一块奇怪的石头……你怎么知道它能救符石护卫？"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_69a09c13:

    # e "I don't know... I just thought it looked cool."
    e "我不知道……只是觉得它看起来很酷。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_39d2cf8c:

    # k "I think the stone contains some... remnant of the rune..."
    k "我觉得这块石头里还残留着一些……符文的力量……"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_dca44186:

    # k "At least we can salvage Naim now."
    k "至少现在我们还能救回纳伊姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_e5b03714:

    # e "Is it this guardian's name?"
    e "这是这名守护者的名字吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_64ac4548:

    # k "Yes."
    k "是。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_719a1cd2:

    # k "Let him rest here a little."
    k "让他在这里休息一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_51770df3:

    # "The guardian stays unconscious after the fight, you decide to check in on Furkan at the back."
    "战斗结束后，符石护卫仍昏迷不醒。你决定去后面看看弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_5121ca19:

    # "Soon, the guardian crumbles into dust, just like the last one."
    "很快，符石护卫就像上一个一样化为尘土。"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_6fb165f8:

    # k "Hmm..."
    k "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_8d125bb3:

    # k "Now both of them are gone now..."
    k "现在两尊护卫都不在了……"

translate schinese_rewrite runeguardian_win_6c4c18c3:

    # "Stepping over the dust that the guardian leaves behind, you decide to check in on Furkan at the back."
    "你跨过符石护卫留下的尘土，决定去后面看看弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_ef6b3876:

    # k "Hey, Furk. Furk! You alright?"
    k "弗克，弗克！你还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a17ba0e9:

    # "The Ram doesn't speak, in fact he still hasn't wake. Kari presses on his chest for a few moment."
    "公羊没有回应；事实上，他还没醒。卡里按住他的胸口片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_f397e375:

    # k "Alright, he's alive. Furk."
    k "好，他还活着。弗克。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_46661de9:

    # "Kari performs healing magic to the unconscious ram."
    "卡里对昏迷的公羊施展治愈魔法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_9a2b7cf9:

    # "Furkan's eyes flutter open, as an anticipated deer watches in relief."
    "弗坎的眼皮颤动着睁开，卡里终于松了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_3ec57d49:

    # f "..."
    f "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_9618a388:

    # k "Furk?"
    k "弗克？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_02545655:

    # f "...W-where am I?"
    f "……我在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_00f52772:

    # "Kari hugs the chief tightly, he positions himself on top of Furkan, feeling all his warmth as you watch from a distance."
    "卡里紧紧抱住酋长，俯身贴着弗坎感受他的体温；你在一旁看着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_068112a1:

    # k "Furk, you almost scared me to death. I thought you were gone."
    k "弗克，你差点吓死我。我还以为你已经不在了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_b7cc3345:

    # f "Uhm... the cave... I came here looking for the golem did I not?"
    f "呃……山洞……我是来找石魔像的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_723c6101:

    # "Kari nods."
    "卡里点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_48014797:

    # e "Hey, Furkan."
    e "嗨，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_7c5afb1c:

    # f "The courier? Why are you here."
    f "信使？你怎么会在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_e5aaaaa3:

    # e "Kari asked me to come with him to save you."
    e "卡里让我和他一起来救你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_f4847294:

    # e "Did you pass out after the guardian attacked you?"
    e "你是被符石护卫打晕的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_ae4b54e1:

    # f "No, it was someone else... the guardian was protecting me."
    f "不，是另一个人……符石护卫当时在保护我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_3bea46d2:

    # k "Please tell me who attacked you, Furkan. I will take my own revenge on them."
    k "告诉我是谁袭击了你，弗坎。我会亲自找他们算账。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_000b35c8:

    # f "They hit me from the back, I have no idea."
    f "他们从背后打了我，我没看清是谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_d4a36c19:

    # "Kari looks disappointed, it seems he cares about the chief a lot by the way he's still hugging him."
    "卡里看起来很失望；他一直抱着酋长，显然非常在乎他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_4312d7b7:

    # f "W-wait..."
    f "等、等等……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_9f94dcc8:

    # f "I lost it."
    f "我把它弄丢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_6a9d299d:

    # k "Father's basin?"
    k "父亲的法盅？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_32a6dc7b:

    # "The general pulls away, looking at Furkan with concern."
    "卡里退开些，担忧地看着弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_1b47d087:

    # k "Oh... No."
    k "哦……不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_ead24320:

    # e "W-what's it?"
    e "什、什么东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_07929565:

    # k "We used it to summon our guardians, or what you called golem."
    k "我们用它召唤守护者，也就是你说的石魔像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_b34597c1:

    # f "Is the guardian doing well?"
    f "符石护卫还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_001113cc:

    # k "Courier used a rock on him, I saw it."
    k "我看见信使用石头砸了它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_93902d70:

    # "You nods slightly as the chief gives you an approving smile."
    "你微微点头，酋长朝你露出赞许的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_46a16c41:

    # "But the smile fades away quickly as he looks back at Kari."
    "但他转头看向卡里，笑容很快消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_5363b379:

    # f "It was stupid of me to come here alone. I did not intend for anyone to follow me."
    f "我一个人来这里太蠢了。我没想过会有人跟着我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_deb4c568:

    # f "But that made the perfect opportunity for an ambush."
    f "却给了伏击者绝佳的机会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_54f08db2:

    # f "How silly I am..."
    f "我真傻……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_58798f39:

    # k "Furk... it's fine. we can find the basin later."
    k "弗克……没事，我们之后再找法盅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_68914fef:

    # f "Where's the guardian?"
    f "守护者在哪里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_98e8204b:

    # k "We killed it. We thought he went rogue on you and he started attacking us."
    k "我们杀了它。我们以为它已经背叛你，还开始攻击我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_f273e2bb:

    # f "Alright."
    f "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_fa11c99b:

    # "Furkan sighs, he looks down, eyes almost teary."
    "弗坎叹了口气，低下头，眼中几乎含泪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a083357a:

    # "He doesn't speak, instead, he grasps on Kari's hand. The general doesn't seem to flich away."
    "他没有说话，只是握住卡里的手。卡里也没有躲开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_ab4dee2a:

    # "Both of them are just mourning, in their own way."
    "两人以各自的方式默默哀悼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_f2da58de:

    # f "So, all of what I did was for nothing."
    f "所以，我做的一切都白费了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_87555c13:

    # f "Guardian died, basin got stolen."
    f "守护者死了，法盅也被偷走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_db3cd737:

    # e "W-what's the basin actually?"
    e "法盅到底是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_f2575d7f:

    # f "It was what my father used to summon guardians, with the help of the runes."
    f "那是我父亲借助符文召唤守护者所用的法器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_095e395f:

    # f "In return, the guardians protect the runes."
    f "作为交换，守护者会保护符文。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_cd0075c1:

    # f "And now I lost both of them."
    f "现在两样都没了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_c3ed46ef:

    # "Kari rubs his paws on Furkan's wound, tending to it carefully."
    "卡里用爪子轻轻擦拭弗坎的伤口，仔细替他处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a534077e:

    # e "I'm really sorry to hear, but we'll try to get them back when you recover."
    e "听到这些我很遗憾，但等你恢复后，我们会想办法把它们找回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_cebe6de1:

    # f "Thanks, both of you. I need to get back to the tribe now."
    f "谢谢你们两个。我现在得回部落了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_8c3907b5:

    # f "Hmm..."
    f "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_486f5a9b:

    # "Furkan stumbles forward when he tries to stand up, you see Kari intuitively lifts him back up."
    "弗坎起身时踉跄了一下，卡里下意识地把他扶了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_6cd031f3:

    # f "Kari?"
    f "卡里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_6d3d914b:

    # k "Yeah... Let's go."
    k "嗯……我们走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_e73388e9:

    # e "Oh... you guys... are going?"
    e "哦……你们要走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a944e8ba:

    # "Kari carries the furkan's exhausted body on his back. The two men grunts a little before walking."
    "卡里把疲惫的弗坎背到背上。两人都轻轻哼了一声，才迈步离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_6409673d:

    # k "U-uhm... Thanks, Courier."
    k "呃……谢谢你，信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_b213370a:

    # k "Here's some recipe that you might want to take a look."
    k "这里有些你可能想看的配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_44668cc5:

    # k "It's iron sword and axe."
    k "是铁剑和铁斧的配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a3ae056d:

    # e "Thanks, general."
    e "谢谢，将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_84fcf348:

    # "He hands you the paper, before tugging the chieftain upwards with his hands on his ass."
    "他把纸递给你，然后双手托住酋长的臀部，把他往上提了提。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_127daacc:

    # k "I'll take our Chief back to our tribe, see you later."
    k "我带酋长回部落，回头见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a5a58d4c:

    # f "Take care."
    f "保重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_ce1cdeaf:

    # e "See you..."
    e "回头见……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_e0df77ea:

    # "Kari turns away from you, and begin walking towards the exit."
    "卡里转身朝出口走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_4c3c3c00:

    # k "{size=20}Furk, since when did you get this heavy.{/size}"
    k "{size=20}弗克，你什么时候变得这么重了？{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_2b1a552a:

    # "They whispers, but the echo in the cave makes it clear even from afar."
    "他们低声说着，但山洞里的回声让你即使在远处也听得清清楚楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_b055cfae:

    # f "{size=20}Uhmm... Heavier if I fall asleep on your shoulder...{/size}"
    f "{size=20}呃……要是我睡在你肩膀上，应该会更重……{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_747772b0:

    # "Kari and Furkan leaves you outside the cave."
    "卡里和弗坎把你送到山洞外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_ed08a457:

    # e "Fuck, Furkan? Are you awake?"
    e "操，弗坎？你醒了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_ad844077:

    # "The Ram is completely passed out, you decide to presses on his chest for a few moment."
    "公羊完全失去了意识，你决定按住他的胸口片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_81fffab3:

    # "With no avail, you lean your head against his chest, luckily his heart is still beating, albeit weakly."
    "没有反应。你把头靠在他的胸口，幸好还能听到微弱的心跳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_282a297e:

    # "You cast a weak healing magic on him."
    "你对他施展微弱的治疗魔法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_3ec57d49_1:

    # f "..."
    f "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_fca3c10c:

    # "The chief's eyes flutter open. He looks stressful, and his pupils dilate."
    "酋长的眼皮颤动着睁开，神情紧张，瞳孔也随之放大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_4e056dcb:

    # f "...W-who..."
    f "……你、你是谁……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_2f3870eb:

    # e "Hey, Furkan. Are you alright?"
    e "嗨，弗坎。你还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_bcda30d6:

    # "He turns his attention to you."
    "他把注意力转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_d06b9227:

    # f "Courier? Why are you here."
    f "信使？你怎么会在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_25d2b6ed:

    # e "Your general told me to save you here..."
    e "你们的将军让我来这里救你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_f0e70fe2:

    # e "He's resting in the tribe now."
    e "他现在正在部落里休息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a3e1f029:

    # "You try to give him a hand as he shifts his position to you, but he doesn't take it."
    "你试图在他挪向你时伸手扶他，但他没有接受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_9f93daa8:

    # f "W-what happened."
    f "发、发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_713df877:

    # e "He fought me as I entered your tribe, I defeated him at the end."
    e "我进入你们部落时，他和我打了一架，最后我打败了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_c492b7b4:

    # e "I didn't intend to, just trying to protect myself. He thought I kidnapped you."
    e "我不是故意要这么做，只是想保护自己。他以为我绑架了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_b329270f:

    # e "Afterwards he told me you might be here..."
    e "后来他告诉我，你可能在这里……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_bbdc0855:

    # "Furkan stares forwards, seemingly pondering something you're not aware of."
    "弗坎望着前方，似乎在思考某件你不知道的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a9d62d89:

    # e "Uhm... Furkan... did you pass out after the guardian attacked you?"
    e "呃……弗坎……你是被符石护卫打晕的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_90f09731:

    # f "No... it was someone else... the guardian was protecting me."
    f "不……是另一个人……符石护卫当时在保护我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_9168b5c7:

    # "He looks around, distressed."
    "他焦虑地环顾四周。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_4312d7b7_1:

    # f "W-wait..."
    f "等、等等……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_9f94dcc8_1:

    # f "I lost it."
    f "我把它弄丢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_32638e3f:

    # f "I lost the basin."
    f "法盅丢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_4341cf81:

    # f "Oh... no no no..."
    f "哦……不、不、不……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_c29fa0c3:

    # e "W-what? The basin?"
    e "什、什么？法盅？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_1dd4c735:

    # f "Fuck! Why am I so useless."
    f "操！我怎么这么没用？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a2ff6800:

    # f "They stole the basin from me. The thieves."
    f "那些小偷把法盅偷走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_2c5adaba:

    # e "Who took it? I didn't see anyone else here in the cave."
    e "是谁拿走的？我没在山洞里看到其他人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_6fea8302:

    # f "They're probably gone, I did not get to catch a glimpse but I sensed someone was there."
    f "他们可能已经走了。我没能看清他们的样子，但我感觉到有人在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_560a4f40:

    # f "...Right before I was ambushed from behind."
    f "……就在我被人从背后伏击之前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_33656c76:

    # e "It's ok, Furkan. We can get it back later. You should focus on recovering first."
    e "没事，弗坎。我们以后可以把它找回来，你应该先专心养伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a13c0780:

    # "You lend your hand again towards Furkan, this time he reluctantly accepts it."
    "你再次向弗坎伸出手，这次他犹豫着接受了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_39000206:

    # "With your assistance, Furkan turns against a huge rock to lean on."
    "在你的帮助下，弗坎转过身，靠在一块巨大的岩石上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_b34597c1_1:

    # f "Is the guardian doing well?"
    f "符石护卫还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_8d754181:

    # e "Yes, the stone was healing him quite a bit."
    e "是的，那块石头让它恢复了不少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_0e8db784:

    # f "What stone?"
    f "什么石头？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_9520fe9c:

    # "You show him the rock you found at the lake, apparently it's been soaked in magical energy enough to heal a golem."
    "你给他看在湖边找到的石头；它似乎吸收了足够的魔法能量，能够治愈石魔像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_051170e6:

    # f "Thank god."
    f "谢天谢地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_2ff7bb12:

    # "Furkan sighs, he is looking at the guardian, panting."
    "弗坎叹了口气，望向守护者，喘着气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_85b84d75:

    # f "It was stupid of me to come here alone. I know the guardian is here."
    f "我一个人来这里太蠢了。我知道守护者就在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_d3d886a4:

    # "He looks down, hands over his face."
    "他低下头，用手捂住脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_deb4c568_1:

    # f "But that made the perfect opportunity for an ambush."
    f "却给了伏击者绝佳的机会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_da4677b2:

    # f "How silly am I..."
    f "我真傻……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_6e1fdc41:

    # e "Look, don't worry about it..."
    e "别担心……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_68914fef_1:

    # f "Where's the guardian?"
    f "守护者在哪里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_8fbbec14:

    # e "He attacked me... So I killed it."
    e "它袭击了我……所以我杀了它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_f273e2bb_1:

    # f "Alright."
    f "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_fa11c99b_1:

    # "Furkan sighs, he looks down, eyes almost teary."
    "弗坎叹了口气，低下头，眼中几乎含泪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_f2da58de_1:

    # f "So, all of what I did was for nothing."
    f "所以，我做的一切都白费了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_87555c13_1:

    # f "Guardian died, basin got stolen."
    f "守护者死了，法盅也被偷走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_db3cd737_1:

    # e "W-what's the basin actually?"
    e "法盅到底是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_f2575d7f_1:

    # f "It was what my father used to summon guardians, with the help of the runes."
    f "那是我父亲借助符文召唤守护者所用的法器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_095e395f_1:

    # f "In return, the guardians protect the runes."
    f "作为交换，守护者会保护符文。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_cd0075c1_1:

    # f "And now I lost both of them."
    f "现在两样都没了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_534602b9:

    # "He turns away, ears droop low."
    "他转过身去，双耳低垂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a534077e_1:

    # e "I'm really sorry to hear, but we'll try to get them back when you recover."
    e "听到这些我很遗憾，但等你恢复后，我们会想办法把它们找回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_0623b8b8:

    # f "Thanks, Courier. I need to get back to the tribe now."
    f "谢谢你，信使。我现在得回部落了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_8c3907b5_1:

    # f "Hmm..."
    f "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_5685146e:

    # "Furkan stumbles forward when he tries to stand up. He lands on the floor again with a loud thump."
    "弗坎起身时踉跄了一下，随后重重摔回地面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_3ec57d49_2:

    # f "..."
    f "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_6af2229e:

    # f "Courier, can you ask Kari to send his people here?"
    f "信使，你能让卡里派人来这里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_6d9927f9:

    # e "Do you need a hand?"
    e "需要我扶你吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_ec3f1531:

    # f "No need. You've been a great help already. I just need the guards to take me back."
    f "不用。你已经帮了大忙，我只需要卫兵把我带回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_bbec41a3:

    # e "What about the guardian?"
    e "那守护者呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_85ee5c06:

    # f "I suppose we will carry it back."
    f "我想，我们会把它带回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_1d3e7715:

    # f "Not sure if he will still go rogue, so we will put him in captivity."
    f "不知道它还会不会继续失控，所以我们会把它关起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_41569b97:

    # f "There is just nothing left for it to protect."
    f "它已经没有需要保护的东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_6619e846:

    # "Furkan takes another pause."
    "弗坎又停顿了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_049ac92c:

    # f "You can leave me here now... Thank you again, Courier."
    f "你现在可以把我留在这里了……再次谢谢你，信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_End_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
